{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6e8501fa0b125293763d751001e1d70e0efb49bff8e6db0371694648c5f6ec0c", "ja": "燃えるせつなさ、アクアリウス！", "zh": "燃烧的悲伤，Aquarius！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "74ec10464ec067601449b29d76a2dabbaa983aec73e0c2e3f941794d9845a336", "ja": "次の天体公演でお披露目になる、せつない失\n恋ソングを歌うために集められた、麗花、紗\n代子、ジュリア。ユニット名は『アクアリウ\nス』に決まり、せつなさを表現するために目\n指すのは、3人ならではのハーモニー！", "zh": "为了演唱将在下一场天体公演中首次亮相的、令人心酸的失恋歌曲而聚集起来的丽花、纱代子和茱莉亚。组合名定为『水瓶座』，为了表现心酸之情，目标是3人独有的和声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d567cb5aebb34873a2e8ef33a4a08177a14082da3ccea89a66935e23e25be33", "ja": "（次の天体公演のメンバーが決まり、\n今日は初顔合わせだ。みんな、もう揃ってるかな？）", "zh": "（下一场天体公演的成员已经确定了，今天是第一次见面。大家应该都到齐了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "9df46473f52f435630ac6d5cbd319eccd916ead9280123f66fa9253213ac0826", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、待ってました！\nそれじゃさっそく行きましょうか？　レッツゴーゴー♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，等你好久了！\n那么我们马上出发吧？出发出发♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cbe3452bc99353f0f41aaf168ee17d1be2d8db215e9dd49d79c2a920c70862d4", "ja": "えっ？　行くってどこに……？", "zh": "咦？你说要去，是去哪里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "b3652b195262345a1c5dee3649117e794fc52e579b31484c87c8f773f5c08d3c", "ja": "もちろん、ピクニックです♪\n任せてください、オススメの山があるんですよ！", "zh": "当然是去野餐啦♪\n请交给我吧，我知道一座很推荐的山哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "ea067d488488ab6b67f7795557b05d799d66ebc9fde66710058368c5bd6685fd", "ja": "登山って、肺活量が鍛えられるんですよね。\n私、全力で頂上を目指します！", "zh": "登山能锻炼肺活量，对吧。\n我会全力向山顶进发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "4bd02389665b45bc30399c44f5ab4f97b19ab334d047b615516c4cb78c84d8d7", "ja": "つーか、劇場に来る前に言ってくれよ……。\n普通あるだろ、準備とかいろいろ！", "zh": "话说，你在来剧场之前倒是先说一声啊……\n一般不是该准备准备、做点什么的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9fbbc4ed62b2938a2e01e139d4d86b9fe23270c6a3d4f9fee96e2b075999e950", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ！\nどうしてピクニックに行く話に？", "zh": "等、等一下！\n怎么突然变成要去野餐了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "570a0a6d0bb802e682a5d2ab87b998fe11de5095a428e28728db6ef79e6bba23", "ja": "はい、私と紗代子ちゃんとジュリアちゃんなら、\nピクニックかな～って！", "zh": "我、纱代子和茱莉亚一起的话，去野餐挺不错的吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "15cacc9456386269dd8211eae841ec170d2a6d4ed9dcc065be1e5b31c77c2370", "ja": "……いや、3人に集まってもらったのは、\n今度の天体公演の話をするためなんだ。", "zh": "……不是，叫来3个人，是为了商量下次的天体公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "bc96dfbe392d94d234e187f7e24532be024940ef43c4956f4f0df9d03c5f43ac", "ja": "天体公演？　ということは……もしかして、\n私たち3人でユニットを組むんですか！？", "zh": "天体公演？　这么说来……难道说，\n是要由我们3个人来组建组合吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "7cf03a41a157da185b060d0748d7e21d0c41fcb92bf9bd374e7274c44d2c3238", "ja": "なんだ、そういうことなら大歓迎！\n……レイ、適当なこと言うなよな？", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是这么回事，那我当然欢迎！\n……丽，你可别乱说啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ce39928bc46d6ef2c4a5ea32c6e033216b350f301fb42bc80a244380e9d2f6d", "ja": "わーいわーい♪　お星さまに会いに行く公演ですね？\nお客さんと一緒に、劇場でピクニックです♪", "zh": "好耶好耶♪这是去和星星见面的公演吧？\n和观众一起，在剧场里野餐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "d222f768c55933729b3596e4fd60d1d79938847a29c40b25a6b5d3e03ad57e76", "ja": "つながるのか……。", "zh": "能联系上吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2dee3e17a4b1a91a2e1fd9f32659df3e190a420470ec5117a69c667bf855362f", "ja": "まあ、誤解は解けたみたいでよかったよ。\nで、早速だけど……まずはこの曲を聞いてみてくれ。", "zh": "误会解开了就好。\n那么言归正传……先听听这首歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "ccf0f23fe1c4ea5c3f9d379e11e0c93d43f63a194515790081fee5335d52c20c", "ja": "わあ……♪", "zh": "哇……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "ccf0f23fe1c4ea5c3f9d379e11e0c93d43f63a194515790081fee5335d52c20c", "ja": "わあ……♪", "zh": "哇……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "7af4279dcbff2185be534b9b3f27327a20992c40dd151aee120d9820b5168194", "ja": "へえ……♪", "zh": "哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "e77141ad0313814046516989be0d374553a3af9dcdb0ab2142067a72674f6aa7", "ja": "……キレイな曲じゃないか。\n慣れちゃいないけど……うん、キライじゃない。", "zh": "……挺优美的一首歌嘛。\n虽然我不太习惯这种风格……不过，嗯，并不讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "5180e7a02f72d3bf23d9d196a474eb1fb71d2310fc27d9f2cc40041635bc3734", "ja": "しっとりとして、せつないメロディですね……。\n失恋の歌なのかな？", "zh": "旋律舒缓而又动人，是一首令人伤感的曲子呢……。\n这是失恋的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "49d4546ec1dc7d8130fe11851ad6b51fd582418947182c73d2a2184a81d591ab", "ja": "胸がきゅーって、ちょっぴり……\n悲しい気持ちになっちゃいますね。", "zh": "胸口有点揪紧……不知不觉就觉得有些难过了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9fda4f2ca33179c6395201eb211dd98ea3e9c01b81c15f4c799afb7a3c9b11ab", "ja": "そう、今まで3人に歌ってもらったのとは、\nかなり違うタイプの曲だと思う。", "zh": "对，我觉得这首歌和之前让3人唱过的歌，类型相当不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c6de160793aa98ee950e27f9b1eae7b17d88c4c377e223d09f561a1b49b4fd63", "ja": "この曲を、説得力を持って歌うのは大変そうだけど。\nやってくれるか？", "zh": "要有说服力地唱好这首歌，似乎很不容易。\n你愿意接下这个挑战吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "47096e67f4d60683ac2a0de93352f9b33b8215c66d749036a19f86fa0e0fa959", "ja": "ふふん♪　当たり前だろ？\n大変だからって、逃げ出してたまるもんか。なあ？", "zh": "哼哼♪这不是理所当然的吗？\n怎么能因为困难就逃跑呢。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "8a58e03bb85990c5f305489cf489278d55771e94bc1df9838cbceda543cdbe8b", "ja": "私も、挑戦してみたいです！\nハードルは乗り越えるためにあるんですから！", "zh": "我也想挑战一下！\n毕竟，难关就是要跨越的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f6b91ed66dadacd1a93e41603cc33a7af381813a432a42154599907068f0bb45", "ja": "よし、ふたりとも頼もしい返事だな！\nそれで麗花は……", "zh": "好，你们两个的回答都很可靠呢！\n那丽花呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "90b4afaa5dd8629a59173fdec319e9734c156702eb745c34b75a615ca7f2ad84", "ja": "はい、なんとかなっちゃうかな？\nって思います♪", "zh": "嗯，我觉得总会有办法的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ebfed75c01bc5cd8ce02c075f0bae0528ad2d754b5fd11afa88a64643d4558bc", "ja": "……よし、なんとかしちゃってくれ。\n3人とも、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "……好，那就交给你去搞定吧。\n你们3个，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "80d1cffe172afb231e5f6735a40263402935f5e11358a38c3d632385cb037110", "ja": "あ、そういえば……。\n私たち3人のユニット名は、もう決まってるんですか？", "zh": "啊，说起来……\n我们3人的组合名已经决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "80adf38e0aac916b03b50f3dd30e39a0a0565ad65174250fda5c020939cfe707", "ja": "ああ、一応な。この曲の透明感とか、\n3人の歌声をイメージして……", "zh": "啊，这个嘛，已经定下来了。是参考了这首歌的通透感，还有3人的歌声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_1033", "source_sha256": "62d3d17b6d3f7dc08e5237694e4c0be10f5e079b89df42d1066f919792f24f32", "ja": "アクアリウス", "zh": "阿奎里乌斯", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "15aa2502c66fd2d07203f080c96294de58af352f46c46a59f1a8513d98ca2f29", "ja": "アクアリウス、がいいと思ってるんだ。\n水瓶座のことなんだけど。", "zh": "我觉得叫“水瓶座”挺好的。\n指的是水瓶座。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2001_027say", "source_sha256": "ab27b0ea26b04e559b7d518a6e82185c27fef598d9fa144edef37c292c3d8dbe", "ja": "わあ……！\nふふっ、おしとやかな、キレイな響きですね♪", "zh": "哇……！\n呵呵，听起来既文静又优美呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2002_048rei", "source_sha256": "03c692d13a2797d240916911ae67d9fb8aed6afcb3b27399f74ee3685dca7621", "ja": "普通で素敵です♪　{$P$}さんは、\n今日からアクアデューサーさんですね♪", "zh": "普通又美好呢♪　{$P$}先生，\n从今天起就是Aqua制作人了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "13e26c528f2363bd766892544e8d8f3b6665401b9a00f7ae148c5006877cbe56", "ja": "あたしも気に入ったよ。\nま、ちょっと、くすぐったい気もするけど……。", "zh": "我也挺喜欢的。嗯，不过嘛，感觉还是有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2004_p", "source_sha256": "ffad59adc02c66577766e2280371457d08424ff848482c655e567a18f6923a9f", "ja": "せっかく新曲を歌うんだ。今までのイメージとは違う、\n新しいイメージを意識してもらいたいと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "难得要演唱新歌，我希望你能有意识地展现出不同于以往形象的新形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2005_050jul", "source_sha256": "55be400fbebe189442024939823b8d517a6eb6bfcb62529186e11cb4f4941020", "ja": "なるほど、新境地ってヤツか。\nOK、まかしときな！", "zh": "原来如此，就是所谓的全新境界吧。\n好，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2006_027say", "source_sha256": "eb2eb992d08a8abebc26f2b4fa0c7f44873acf6f20fd4df3a889f34afe69c3b6", "ja": "私もファンのみんなに、せつない私を\n見てもらえるように、全力でがんばります！", "zh": "我也会全力以赴，让粉丝们看到我感伤的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2007_048rei", "source_sha256": "b8652d7ee70b41b5b51b5d96adfd28f4466fa214a735842abad9103c4aeb0a4a", "ja": "せつない新境地に、3人で飛びこんじゃおうね！\nざっぱーん♪", "zh": "让我们3个人一起跳进这片伤感的新境界吧！哗啦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_01_2008_p", "source_sha256": "0edd17a0bbca74ee904d0e2637a6fd0d33128617894a53d797e37fbe1b34e7e8", "ja": "（……と、こんな3人が切ない情感を表現できれば、\nきっと話題になる。しっかりサポートしていこう！）", "zh": "（……要是这样3个人能表现出这种感伤的情怀，一定会引起话题。我要好好支持他们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
